{{!-- The details cell of an item row in a sheet (item-row.md), never posted to chat: the item's rules and
description. Parameters: rules, description (the item's rich text). A row with lines of its own before them writes
the cell and includes _detail-text.hbs. --}}
{{#if (or rules description)}}
  <div class="l5r4-item-row-details">
    {{> "systems/l5r4-enhanced/templates/cards/_partials/_detail-text.hbs" rules=rules description=description}}
  </div>
{{/if}}
